  "steps": [
    "Blend the mayonnaise, chipotles, adobo sauce, chili powder, sugar, salt, garlic powder, onion powder and paprika until smooth; use now or chill to develop flavor.",
    "Simmer the ground beef in water with the taco seasoning, without browning first, until tender and the liquid has mostly cooked off.",
    "Warm the rice according to the package.",
    "Warm a burrito-size tortilla, then spread a spoonful of nacho cheese in the middle and sprinkle on shredded cheddar.",
    "Lay a taco-size tortilla on top of the cheese.",
    "Add a scoop of rice, a scoop of taco meat, some chipotle sauce and a dollop of sour cream.",
    "Fold in the sides and roll up tightly like a burrito.",
    "Toast seam-side down in a dry skillet over medium heat until lightly browned, then flip and brown the other side."
  ],
  "equipment": [
    "blender",
    "skillet"
  ],
  "tips": [
    "Simmering the meat in water and seasoning, without browning, gives a softer fast-food texture.",
    "The chipotle sauce keeps in the fridge and gets better as it rests."
  ],
